@startuml offering-autonomous-realization-boundary
title Offering / Autonomous Offering Realization Boundary ; per ADR-ES-019 section 1 + section 2 + section 3

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Offering" as O
class "Autonomous Offering" as AO
class "Material Autonomous Realization" as MAR

O <|-- AO : specializes
AO *-- MAR : material-evidence

class "Context Assessment" as CA
class "Decision Selection" as DS
class "Action Selection" as AS
class "Configuration Selection" as CS
class "Composition Selection" as CmpS
class "Coordination" as Coord
class "Adaptation" as Adp
class "Exception Interpretation" as EI
class "Bounded Autonomous Decision-Making" as BADM
class "Escalation" as Esc

MAR --> CA
MAR --> DS
MAR --> AS
MAR --> CS
MAR --> CmpS
MAR --> Coord
MAR --> Adp
MAR --> EI
MAR --> BADM
MAR --> Esc

note bottom of MAR
  Material autonomous realization requires substantive
  evidence in one or more of the listed dimensions per
  ADR-ES-019 section 6.
end note

@enduml
